To compile this library it is necessary to have Boost, GSL and blitz++ installed

It is necessary to make the libeigen.a file. Follow the Makefile in the folder <eigen> provided to this code. Modify the Makefile to be adjusted to your computer's enviroment

Compile against your Boost, GSL and blitz++ libraries: g++ -shared -Wl,-soname,libdson.so -o libdavidson.so -L /your/libraries/path -fPIC *.cpp ./eigen/libeigen.a -lgsl -lgslcblas


According to the library the name can be:
libdavidson.so
liblanczos.so
libmorse.so
